# Real COBOL/copybook source fetched verbatim from carddemo-tenant-service must stay byte-exact
# on every machine, regardless of that machine's own core.autocrlf setting -- these fixtures are
# verified byte-for-byte against the real repo's git blob SHAs (see
# tests/system/test_tenant_repo.py's module docstring), and that verification is meaningless if
# git silently normalizes line endings on checkout/commit. `-text` disables any line-ending
# conversion entirely: some real upstream files are LF-only, at least one (CODATECN.cpy) is
# genuinely CRLF -- both must round-trip through git unchanged.
tests/fixtures/tenant_repo_sample/** -text
